WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:02.740
I am about four inches tall.

2
00:00:02.740 --> 00:00:05.780
For over four thousand years, I

3
00:00:05.780 --> 00:00:07.240
have stood like this:

4
00:00:07.240 --> 00:00:09.770
hand on hip, chin up.

5
00:00:10.213 --> 00:00:11.953
Archaeologists found me in a

6
00:00:11.953 --> 00:00:13.293
house at Mohenjo daro.

7
00:00:13.293 --> 00:00:15.573
They call me the Dancing Girl.

8
00:00:15.573 --> 00:00:18.163
Nobody asked my name.

9
00:00:18.944 --> 00:00:19.804
Look closely.

10
00:00:19.804 --> 00:00:22.904
Bangles cover my left arm almost

11
00:00:22.904 --> 00:00:24.084
to the shoulder.

12
00:00:24.084 --> 00:00:26.224
A necklace with three pendants

13
00:00:26.224 --> 00:00:27.834
rests at my throat.

14
00:00:28.341 --> 00:00:30.241
I was made by the lost wax

15
00:00:30.241 --> 00:00:33.161
method. First, a little figure

16
00:00:33.161 --> 00:00:34.291
of wax.

17
00:00:34.798 --> 00:00:37.018
Then a coat of clay, left to

18
00:00:37.018 --> 00:00:40.398
dry. Heat melted the wax, and it

19
00:00:40.398 --> 00:00:42.648
ran out through a tiny hole.

20
00:00:43.183 --> 00:00:45.663
Molten metal filled the hollow.

21
00:00:45.663 --> 00:00:47.903
When it cooled, the clay was

22
00:00:47.903 --> 00:00:48.943
taken away.

23
00:00:48.943 --> 00:00:50.853
And there I was.

24
00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:53.313
The same craft made a buffalo

25
00:00:53.313 --> 00:00:55.433
with its head raised, and a

26
00:00:55.433 --> 00:00:58.553
goat. Bronze casting was popular

27
00:00:58.553 --> 00:01:00.963
in all the great Indus cities.

28
00:01:01.576 --> 00:01:03.956
My feet broke off long ago.

29
00:01:03.956 --> 00:01:06.626
I still look ready to dance.

30
00:01:07.925 --> 00:01:08.785
For GS1:

31
00:01:08.785 --> 00:01:11.265
Harappan bronzes were cast by

32
00:01:11.265 --> 00:01:12.725
the lost wax method.

33
00:01:12.725 --> 00:01:15.665
The Dancing Girl of Mohenjo daro

34
00:01:15.665 --> 00:01:17.775
is the best known example.

35
00:01:18.852 --> 00:01:19.792
Wax melts.

36
00:01:19.792 --> 00:01:20.952
Clay breaks.

37
00:01:20.952 --> 00:01:23.922
What is made with care, stays.
